WEBVTT

00:26:27.496 --> 00:26:31.579
a situation of judgment where there
is no clearly good answer,

00:26:31.913 --> 00:26:35.871
careful thinking is painful,
it's difficult,

00:26:35.871 --> 00:26:39.496
and it leaves you in a state
of indecision or in a state

00:26:39.496 --> 00:26:42.788
or even if one option is
better than the other.

00:26:43.038 --> 00:26:46.788
You know that the difference is not
something you can be sure of,

00:26:47.038 --> 00:26:51.204
whereas when you go to the intuitive route
, you'll end up with all, you know,

00:26:51.204 --> 00:26:54.413
with overconfident certainty and
feeling good about yourself.

00:26:54.704 --> 00:26:56.121
So it's an easy choice.

00:26:56.288 --> 00:26:57.288
I think

00:26:58.663 --> 00:27:01.204
you you wrote about this topic at length